@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "About";
}



<!-- content
    ================================================== -->
<section class="s-content">

    <div class="row">
        <div class="column large-12">

            <article class="s-content__entry">

                <div class="s-content__media">
                    <img src="images/thumbs/about/about-1050.jpg" srcset="images/thumbs/about/about-2100.jpg 2100w, 
                                        images/thumbs/about/about-1050.jpg 1050w, 
                                        images/thumbs/about/about-525.jpg 525w"
                        sizes="(max-width: 2100px) 100vw, 2100px" alt="">

                </div> <!-- end s-content__media -->

                <div class="s-content__entry-header">
                    <h1 class="s-content__title">Learn More About Sufee.</h1>
                </div> <!-- end s-content__entry-header -->

                <div class="s-content__primary">

                    <div class="s-content__page-content">

                        <p class="lead">
                            Sufee is a sacred space for seekers of the unseen — a digital shrine where the verses of
                            mystics echo through time. Here, poems are not just read, but felt; words become whirling
                            dervishes, and every line dances with divine longing. Lose yourself in couplets that carry
                            centuries of wisdom, and discover texts that trace the journey of the soul through love,
                            loss, silence, and surrender. This is not merely a library — it’s a living heartbeat of the
                            Sufi spirit.
                        </p>

                        <p>
                            Whether you are here for a brief moment or a lifelong pilgrimage, Sufee offers something
                            rare — the chance to listen to the silence between the words. Our curated eBooks, rare
                            manuscripts, and timeless poetries connect hearts across cultures, offering comfort in
                            solitude and companionship in reflection.
                        </p>

                        <p>
                            From Rumi’s aching metaphors to Bulleh Shah’s fearless truths, Sufee is your home for all
                            things mystical, metaphorical, and meaningful. Let your journey inward begin here — where
                            every click is a step closer to the divine.
                        </p>


                        <br>

                        <div class="row block-large-1-2 block-tab-full s-content__blocks">

    <div class="column">
        <img src="~/images/slide1-bg-3000.jpg" alt="Sufi Poet" style="width:100%; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);">
        <p style="margin-top: 1rem;">
            At Sufee, each word is a ripple in the ocean of divine love. This space is a tribute to those timeless poets whose verses transcend the limits of language. Through carefully curated content, we hope to bring you closer to the stillness and beauty of Sufi thought — an inner sanctuary in digital form. <br> <br>
            From Rumi’s aching metaphors to Bulleh Shah’s fearless truths, Sufee is your home for all.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="column">
       
        <p style="margin-top: 1rem;">
            From qawwalis that stir the soul to eBooks that preserve ancient whispers, Sufee is a haven for dreamers and devotees alike. Whether you’re exploring for the first time or returning for inspiration, this is your sacred corner of the internet — a place where silence, rhythm, and revelation meet.
        </p>
         <img src="~/images/slide3-bg-3000.jpg" alt="Sufi Gathering" style="width:100%; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);">
    </div>

</div>

                    </div> <!-- end s-entry__page-content -->

                </div> <!-- end s-content__primary -->
            </article> <!-- end entry -->

        </div> <!-- end column -->
    </div> <!-- end row -->

</section> <!-- end s-content -->